_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/EPCISDocument> .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "" .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A downstream operator (Waldwirtschaft Schmidt GmbH) declares a temporary exemption for a specific batch of European Oak round wood, asserting that the batch originated from already-verified low-risk sources per EUDR Article 2.17 (downstream operator simplified due diligence). The exemption is scoped to batch LOT-2026-Q1-0042 and valid from 2026-04-15 to 2026-07-15." .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Architecture: the event references identifiers by URI — GTIN in epcList, GLN in readPoint/bizLocation, party GLN in source/destination. Model-, location-, and party-level master data is served by the GS1 Digital Link / Web Vocabulary resolver when those URIs are dereferenced; it is NOT embedded in the event." .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "EANCOM equivalence: In EANCOM syntax this exemption would be carried as IMD segment C272:DE7081='TEMPORARY_EXEMPTION' + C273:DE7009 with reason code 'DOWNSTREAM_VERIFIED_LOW_RISK'. The batch scope LOT-2026-Q1-0042 would appear in GIN segment under SG22. See GS1 standardization for the full EANCOM solution." .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "EUDR Exemption Declaration: reference pattern for GS1 standardization." .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "GDSN equivalence: The equivalent GDSN master data structure is defined in GS1 standardization." .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "GS1 XML equivalence: The equivalent GS1 XML structure is defined in GS1 standardization." .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "GS1 demo prefix 952 (7-digit GCP: 9521234)." .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HTTP header: GS1-Extensions: oec=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/common/core/,eudr=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/eu/eudr/" .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "See: extensions/common/core/docs/EPCIS_MASTERDATA_AND_EXTENSIONS.md" .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Status: Reference pattern; the EANCOM/XML/GDSN specifications are authoritative. This EPCIS JSON-LD example demonstrates the equivalent semantics for projects using EPCIS as their data sharing layer." .
_:b169_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "gs1:masterDataAvailableFor carries ONLY item/lot-level master data (e.g. countryOfOrigin, regulatoryInformation, harvestDate, EUDR plot geolocation). ilmd carries lot/instance data of the items this event creates. Observation extensions sit at event level." .
